This MIT license covers the FIRST-PARTY work in this repository: the UWP entry point and
compatibility layer (src/), the patch, build, packaging and verification tooling (tools/), the
package manifest (package/), and the documentation.

The game project this builds on, HarbourMasters/Lighthouse
(https://github.com/HarbourMasters/Lighthouse), is CC0-1.0, and the engine the patches touch,
libultraship (MIT, Copyright (c) 2022 kenix3), asks for attribution: MIT is the license that
covers both honestly. The shape of the solution comes from JRickey/Starship (CC0-1.0), whose
patches are not reused here.

This license does NOT and cannot grant rights in Banjo-Kazooie, its code, its assets or its
trademarks.
This repository contains no game ROM, no game assets and no built executable. What is quoted
